## 3. Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as OpportunityDetails (React)
    participant FS as OpportunityService (Frontend)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant BS as OpportunityService (Backend)
    participant Repo as OpportunityRepository
    participant DB as Database

    Student->>UI: Selects an opportunity
    UI->>FS: Request opportunity details (ID)
    FS->>API: GET /api/opportunities/{id}
    API->>BS: get_details(id)
    BS->>Repo: find_by_id(id)
    Repo->>DB: Query opportunity
    DB-->>Repo: Return opportunity record
    Repo-->>BS: Return opportunity
    BS-->>API: Return formatted details
    API-->>FS: JSON response
    FS-->>UI: Return opportunity data
    UI-->>Student: Display opportunity details
```
